        <tr class="row">
          <td class="body" valign="top">
            <table border="0" height="100" width="100%" cellspacing="2" cellpadding="2">
              <tr>
                <td valign="top"><font class="body">While camping the dervishes in WC tonight, my group and I ran into a lvl 52 cavalier named Cenadil - I missed her last name. While we were briefly distracted, she ran into the derv camp and slaughtered everything that was up. When one of the group members shouted that we were camping the area, she finished off the last of the dervishes and then ran off without saying a word. It wasn&#39;t a major incident - at least she didn&#39;t train the camp on us - but it was annoying, especially as the character belongs to a guild which, I understand, has a much better reputation than this person is currently representing (Second Age). <p>Sirar<br>14 Warrior</font></td>
              </tr>
            </table>
            <table border="0" width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
